        <mxCell id="p5-UMLSequenceS-31" value="&lt;b&gt;Node vs Java&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Node escapes % and _ in filters (matched literally).&lt;br&gt;• Node rejects unknown orderBy with 400; Java falls back to id.&lt;br&gt;• Node pg parsers keep JSON identical: int8 → number, timestamp → &quot;2026-09-23T02:04:36.293703&quot;.&lt;br&gt;• Java picks one of 4 derived / JPQL queries; Node runs a single parameterised SQL." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
